# This file exists only to keep the empty ``static/`` directory tracked by
# Git.  Git does not track empty directories; an empty placeholder file is
# the standard idiom for preserving the directory structure in a repository.
#
# The directory holds assets served directly by the FastAPI backend (e.g.
# locally hosted images, custom CSS overrides, or OpenAPI branding).  It is
# mounted at application startup by ``nexusdl.interfaces.web.backend.main``
# and is intentionally empty in the source tree — everything it will serve
# is produced at build or deployment time.
#
# Do not delete this file unless the directory is populated with a tracked
# asset.  Do not add content here: this placeholder must remain harmless if
# accidentally served by the static file handler.
